<title>GREECE: SIGMA SECURITIES SPONSORS CINEMA POSTER EXHIBIT.</title>
<headline>SIGMA SECURITIES SPONSORS CINEMA POSTER EXHIBIT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange member Sigma Securities is sponsoring a &quot;Painting in the Cinema&quot; exhibit at the national gallery during October 23 to November 11.</p>
<p>The exhibit features the Hellafi collection of painted giant cinema posters, lithographs and models by Greek artists in the years 1950-1975.</p>
<p>Other sponsors for the exhibition include OTE telecom, Virgin Atlantic, Volos Technical Co. and Agricultural Life. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
